# Tests
tests/**/output.json
tests/**/package-lock.json
tests/fixtures/**/*
# ... except the hand-authored lab fixture, which is source: the committed goldens are
# generated from it, so an ignored copy would make them unreproducible.
!tests/fixtures/lab/
!tests/fixtures/lab/**
tests/fixtures/lab/node_modules/
!tests/fixtures/globals-lab/
!tests/fixtures/globals-lab/**
